# AI PM Portfolio Setup

Welcome to this portfolio workspace. This repository is not a single app; it is a collection of AI, product, and research artifacts meant to support an AI Product Manager portfolio.

## What this workspace contains

This folder includes:

- transformer model experiments for toxic / harmful comment classification
- BERT and RoBERTa comparison scripts
- performance and evaluation visuals
- product / UX artifacts such as a memory game and a dark-theme PRD

Together, these pieces help tell the story of a product-minded AI professional who understands both technical feasibility and user-centered problem solving.

---

## Project themes

### 1. AI safety and moderation

The main ML work focuses on classifying harmful online comments using transformer models. This connects directly to trust & safety, community moderation, and scalable content review.

### 2. Product strategy and requirements

The memory game project and PRD show a structured product mindset: problem definition, user needs, acceptance criteria, and feature validation.

### 3. Portfolio storytelling

The goal is to communicate that you can reason about:

- business value
- user impact
- model limitations
- responsible AI considerations
- experimentation and iteration

